    "created_at": "2018-01-29T16:35:15Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-01-29T16:35:15Z",
    "body": "Executing or not executing makes a difference because of the \"already started\" flag (set later, in step 8). In particular a pattern is having a script element in the document and setting the `src` attribute or setting `textContent` later needs to execute (or not), depending on the anatomy of the `script` element earlier in its life cycle.\r\n\r\nPossibly it can be changed to \"check if the child text content is not the empty string\", not sure.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
