    "updated_at": "2018-01-29T18:34:56Z",
    "body": "Great, so it is observable, so I'll test what browsers implement. If they follow the current IMO over-complicated spec, we should add a note for any future passers-by who might get confused like me. If they follow what I think is a bit more reasonable, then we fix the spec :). But yeah, I'm not proposing any change to browsers here.",
